# cmdk (Radix) still declares React 18 peers. package.json "overrides" force one
# React 19 and matching @types. If you see ERESOLVE or react@18 in the tree, remove
# node_modules and pnpm-lock.yaml, then run `corepack enable && pnpm install`.
# This project uses pnpm (see "packageManager" in package.json); npm/yarn lockfiles
# are .gitignored so a casual `npm install` cannot create a competing dep tree.
